  m_Text: "Open the iron. Pour batter. Close and cook.\nPlace your cone, scoop flavors,
    add sprinkles, then serve.\n\nWASD to move  \u2022  Mouse to look  \u2022  Space
    to jump / brake\nClick to use tools or serve. E for doors and the driver seat\nE
    while parked to stand up  \u2022  Walk through the rear door\nHold mouse + move
    up/down to scoop or shake\nRight click to put down  \u2022  Q for music"
